# WoW Forever (client game type "camelot", interface 16001). Same code as
# QuickRoute.toc; the location data comes from Data\Forever\, generated by
# scripts/generate_forever_data.py. Data\Provenance.lua is the shared
# vocabulary, Data\DataAccess.lua the shared lookups.
#
# Left out on purpose:
#   Modules\PhasePanel.lua -- Zidormi phase controls. Forever has no phase
#   switch, and the window would list nothing but the retail hint text.

